WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:02.794
We don't have a choice.

00:03.962 --> 00:05.839
We live in a cruel world.

00:15.348 --> 00:17.976
I'm going to drive them out!

00:18.601 --> 00:19.519
No.

00:20.103 --> 00:21.229
Kill them!

00:24.983 --> 00:28.361
Humanity was suddenly reminded that day

00:30.947 --> 00:33.950
of the terror of being at their mercy,

00:36.995 --> 00:41.291
of the humiliation
of being trapped inside a cage.

00:58.016 --> 00:58.892
Eren!

01:00.518 --> 01:01.436
Eren.

02:41.953 --> 02:43.371
Let us pray.

02:43.705 --> 02:49.210
For the solidity of the three goddesses,
Maria, Rose, and Sina.

02:49.586 --> 02:51.546
For our own welfare.

02:52.171 --> 02:55.466
We must not misdoubt the sacred Walls.

02:55.842 --> 02:58.803
These Walls of light
born from the hands of the divine

02:59.220 --> 03:04.893
are made ever more stalwart
through the offering of our faith.

03:05.643 --> 03:08.438
For it is only
the innocence of faithful devotion

03:08.771 --> 03:11.774
that protects us from the Titans.

03:12.025 --> 03:15.862
It, alone, keeps the Titans away from...

03:24.954 --> 03:27.790
A Titan? Here?

03:39.928 --> 03:40.887
No.

03:41.221 --> 03:43.348
Stay away from the Wall.

03:43.973 --> 03:45.016
Stay away!

04:06.788 --> 04:09.540
Looks like he's in control
of himself this time around.

04:09.624 --> 04:10.458
Yes.

04:10.792 --> 04:14.629
But Eren has yet to win against
the Female Titan even once.

04:16.589 --> 04:20.260
If he's transformed, it means
he's got to be ready for the worst.

04:20.677 --> 04:24.764
- He won't lose so--
- Spirit alone can't win a fight.

04:25.265 --> 04:26.724
You experienced that first-hand.

04:28.726 --> 04:30.520
Defeating Annie

04:31.104 --> 04:32.105
will require more!

04:34.315 --> 04:35.233
Level ground!

04:36.859 --> 04:38.194
She's heading for the level ground!

04:38.361 --> 04:40.613
We can't use
omnidirectional mobility gear there!

04:41.197 --> 04:42.991
Split into two teams and go around!

04:43.157 --> 04:44.075
Understood!

04:50.790 --> 04:52.333
Come on!

04:52.458 --> 04:54.711
This is crazy! What are Titans doing here?

05:14.230 --> 05:15.398
Annie.

05:16.149 --> 05:21.612
You always acted like everything
around you was stupid and pointless.

05:22.947 --> 05:25.325
You never seemed interested in anything.

05:28.202 --> 05:31.331
But there are times
when you're full of life.

05:32.248 --> 05:35.126
That's when you show off
those combat skills of yours.

05:36.544 --> 05:39.380
You talked about
how there was no point to it,

05:40.256 --> 05:44.719
but it didn't seem like
you believed that at all.

05:45.511 --> 05:51.559
If anything, you struck me as a bad liar.

05:52.602 --> 05:54.145
Tell me, Annie.

05:54.562 --> 05:58.066
What are you fighting for?

05:58.775 --> 06:02.153
For what cause did you murder people?

06:25.134 --> 06:26.177
Oh, man.

06:26.969 --> 06:27.845
Section Commander.

06:28.179 --> 06:32.350
Even if we do catch the Female Titan,
the city is going to end up in ruins!

06:32.809 --> 06:36.521
That's not our concern.
This is Erwin's decision.

06:37.105 --> 06:38.856
Prepare the capture nets.

06:38.940 --> 06:39.774
Right!

06:43.945 --> 06:44.779
Eren.

06:45.613 --> 06:47.949
No one said anything about this.

06:48.366 --> 06:51.202
Why are there Titans fighting here?

06:51.619 --> 06:53.538
What in the world is happening?

06:54.997 --> 06:57.041
Titans are fighting each other?

06:57.125 --> 07:00.378
Yes. The damage done
to the city is unimaginable.

07:01.254 --> 07:05.049
Scores of civilians and soldiers
have been killed or wounded.

07:06.717 --> 07:10.138
Erwin! Is this the result of your doing?

07:10.930 --> 07:11.973
It is.

07:15.309 --> 07:17.728
I acted entirely on my own authority.

07:18.604 --> 07:20.231
I offer no excuses.

07:24.527 --> 07:27.029
You must have known
what this plan of yours

07:27.155 --> 07:29.323
would have caused in the middle of a city!

07:29.740 --> 07:32.368
Why did you do it?

07:36.372 --> 07:37.623
For mankind's

07:38.958 --> 07:40.209
victory.

07:40.751 --> 07:42.128
Don't give me that!

07:42.962 --> 07:44.338
You're a traitor!

07:44.672 --> 07:48.301
None of the higher-ups will complain
if I execute you right now!

07:49.635 --> 07:50.678
If you wish.

07:51.012 --> 07:51.929
But

07:52.013 --> 07:53.473
you'll be in charge afterward.

07:54.682 --> 07:56.559
Do not let the Female Titan escape.

07:56.893 --> 08:00.271
Peer is in charge of troop deployment.
Beirer is in charge of provisions.

08:00.855 --> 08:02.106
Work with them

08:02.190 --> 08:04.650
- and do whatever it takes--
- Wait! Stop!

08:05.526 --> 08:08.696
Do you really think

08:09.405 --> 08:11.115
this is for humanity's sake?

08:11.741 --> 08:13.826
I have faith it will serve
as a step forward.

08:20.291 --> 08:22.084
Everyone, lower your guns!

08:22.251 --> 08:23.586
Cuff him!

08:24.003 --> 08:24.837
Yes, sir!

08:25.880 --> 08:27.757
Deploy all troops

08:28.216 --> 08:31.302
and focus on aiding
and evacuating the citizens!

08:31.427 --> 08:32.345
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

08:34.138 --> 08:38.351
Erwin, I'll let the court of law decide
how to execute you.

08:39.018 --> 08:41.562
I'll gladly accept that
once everything is over.

08:42.563 --> 08:46.526
Levi. Stay put.
You don't like pointless death.

08:47.109 --> 08:51.322
You're right. I'm not fond of
causing it or experiencing it.

08:57.662 --> 09:00.206
Those who can't abandon anything

09:00.831 --> 09:02.959
can't change anything.

09:04.252 --> 09:06.837
The ability to give up your humanity

09:09.173 --> 09:11.050
when forced to rise above monsters...

09:15.763 --> 09:18.641
I think that's something Annie can do!

09:24.814 --> 09:25.648
Annie...

09:27.608 --> 09:28.442
Annie!

09:49.297 --> 09:50.131
Annie.

09:52.925 --> 09:56.429
Your dad is always on your side.

10:13.029 --> 10:16.073
I will kill

10:17.074 --> 10:18.367
the Titans.

10:20.077 --> 10:22.121
Every last one...

10:47.521 --> 10:48.356
Eren!

10:51.776 --> 10:52.610
Is he...

10:53.527 --> 10:54.779
- Eren!
- Stop!

10:56.072 --> 10:58.699
I'm not sure Eren
will recognize you right now!

11:45.538 --> 11:48.040
- She's on the Wall!
- She intends to climb over!

12:00.594 --> 12:01.429
Oh, no!

12:01.887 --> 12:03.264
She's getting away!

12:06.142 --> 12:07.560
I won't let her!

12:22.908 --> 12:23.826
Annie.

12:25.870 --> 12:26.745
Fall.

12:35.546 --> 12:36.630
Annie.

12:38.424 --> 12:40.009
It was wrong of me.

12:41.552 --> 12:44.054
I won't ask for your forgiveness now.

12:45.514 --> 12:47.850
But all I ask of you

12:48.642 --> 12:49.977
is one thing.

12:54.023 --> 12:56.984
Even if you turn
the whole world against you, it's okay.

13:02.615 --> 13:03.657
I will

13:04.325 --> 13:07.703
destroy the entire world!

13:08.621 --> 13:12.666
Even if the entire world
ends up hating you,

13:13.250 --> 13:16.670
just know that
your dad is always on your side.

13:18.589 --> 13:20.466
Oh, no! He's going to eat
the person inside!

13:20.549 --> 13:22.176
Stop, Eren!

13:22.259 --> 13:23.135
Eren!

13:23.511 --> 13:24.553
I'm

13:24.970 --> 13:26.347
free!

13:27.556 --> 13:29.558
So promise me

13:31.310 --> 13:32.811
that you'll come back.

13:51.497 --> 13:53.207
What's he doing?

13:56.585 --> 13:57.628
What the...

13:59.505 --> 14:00.714
They are merging?

14:10.266 --> 14:11.100
Eren!

14:18.816 --> 14:22.862
Don't go eating
our key evidence, you idiot.

15:01.025 --> 15:01.942
Eren.

15:03.068 --> 15:04.028
Mikasa.

15:05.029 --> 15:05.946
Where's Annie?

15:18.709 --> 15:19.710
Damn it!

15:19.877 --> 15:23.297
What the hell? After all this,
we get the silent treatment?

15:23.589 --> 15:24.506
Annie!

15:25.090 --> 15:26.133
Get out there!

15:26.342 --> 15:28.469
Get out there
and pay for what you've done!

15:28.636 --> 15:30.346
Come on! Don't be a coward!

15:30.512 --> 15:32.556
Annie!

15:34.725 --> 15:35.559
Stop.

15:37.770 --> 15:38.604
It's pointless.

15:43.651 --> 15:45.319
Make a wire net!

15:45.986 --> 15:47.988
Let's get this thing underground!

15:48.155 --> 15:48.989
Understood!

15:51.075 --> 15:55.079
If we end up not getting
any information out of Annie,

15:55.829 --> 15:57.039
what will be left?

15:57.915 --> 16:03.045
Nothing but countless casualties,
ruined lives, and unanswered questions,

16:04.171 --> 16:05.506
all for what?

16:16.642 --> 16:19.770
It seems the plan wasn't
much of a success.

16:20.145 --> 16:24.233
No, I'd say the Scout Regiment
is in the clear now.

16:24.775 --> 16:26.860
Just barely.

16:29.780 --> 16:30.823
Let's hope so.

16:41.208 --> 16:45.462
Erwin, we have a number of questions
concerning this operation.

16:46.380 --> 16:48.966
If you believe you knew
the target's identity,

16:49.425 --> 16:52.094
why didn't you ask for
the Military Police Regiment's assistance?

16:52.428 --> 16:53.262
Sir.

16:53.595 --> 16:57.433
Given the likelihood that
the Female Titan has inside accomplices,

16:58.017 --> 17:01.687
it was necessary to involve
only those above suspicion.

17:02.354 --> 17:06.942
But how do you justify the damage caused
to Stohess as a result of that?

17:07.317 --> 17:11.655
Our ineptitude is to blame.
I offer my sincerest apologies.

17:11.822 --> 17:13.657
Apologies won't fix this!

17:13.991 --> 17:17.411
Had we left her unchecked, the Wall
would have been destroyed eventually.

17:17.703 --> 17:20.247
The ensuing destruction
would have been far worse.

17:20.622 --> 17:21.540
I see.

17:22.416 --> 17:26.128
So do you have any proof that
this devastating operation of yours

17:26.336 --> 17:29.798
has helped to prevent
the downfall of humankind?

17:30.466 --> 17:35.179
I find it unlikely that you'll get
anything out of Annie Leonhart now.

17:36.138 --> 17:38.015
Indeed, I doubt we will.

17:39.141 --> 17:42.352
In other words, it was all for naught?

17:48.442 --> 17:49.359
Eren.

17:58.660 --> 18:00.162
Do you feel all right?

18:02.498 --> 18:03.457
Yes.

18:04.958 --> 18:07.044
It's weird how normal I feel.

18:09.421 --> 18:12.341
I guess Annie is still stuck in there?

18:13.175 --> 18:14.093
Yes.

18:14.927 --> 18:15.761
Damn.

18:16.386 --> 18:19.348
That big of an operation, all for nothing.

18:19.932 --> 18:23.477
Annie went that far to
keep her information safe.

18:23.685 --> 18:26.605
Yes. She slipped
right through our fingers.

18:27.397 --> 18:28.941
Eren let her get away.

18:33.487 --> 18:35.322
Isn't that right, Eren?

18:36.490 --> 18:38.075
If it hadn't been for that brief moment...

18:39.743 --> 18:40.577
Yes.

18:41.495 --> 18:42.996
It's true.

18:44.748 --> 18:46.083
I screwed up.

18:47.668 --> 18:50.838
I froze as soon as I saw her.

18:54.424 --> 18:56.009
Armin Arlelt.

18:56.385 --> 18:57.553
Jean Kirschtein.

18:57.886 --> 18:59.054
You're wanted for debriefing.

18:59.304 --> 19:00.139
Right.

19:00.389 --> 19:01.431
I guess we're up first.

19:01.765 --> 19:03.392
See you later then.

19:03.517 --> 19:04.476
Yes.

19:17.030 --> 19:20.534
It actually felt nice.

19:22.661 --> 19:25.455
Having my body come apart
somehow felt refreshing.

19:27.624 --> 19:31.211
So much that I felt like I wanted to die.

19:31.336 --> 19:32.171
Eren!

19:36.216 --> 19:37.843
I don't want to die now.

19:48.812 --> 19:52.983
I'm glad that you came back.

19:58.697 --> 20:00.490
It's too much for me to understand.

20:01.366 --> 20:04.828
Abandoning your humanity
to rise above monsters...

20:05.704 --> 20:07.497
That's the only way to win?

20:08.415 --> 20:11.793
It's the only hope mankind has
to prevail over the Titans.

20:13.045 --> 20:14.671
I think Eren can do it.

20:17.341 --> 20:18.634
I wonder.

20:18.926 --> 20:21.929
Getting rid of the Titans by
becoming that kind of monster,

20:22.846 --> 20:24.973
would that really be
a victory for humankind?

20:36.151 --> 20:37.027
Eat up.

20:55.420 --> 20:58.632
It won't be easy.

21:00.259 --> 21:01.134
However,

21:02.094 --> 21:07.266
I believe mankind has gained
great potential for survival.

21:10.352 --> 21:14.940
There was a time when we never
even imagined humans becoming Titans.

21:15.732 --> 21:19.403
Compared to then, capturing a member
of the enemy is an enormous step forward.

21:19.903 --> 21:22.698
Yes. There are more out there.

21:23.240 --> 21:24.950
And we will go after every last one.

21:25.784 --> 21:29.121
This time, it is our turn to launch

21:30.747 --> 21:33.125
an attack on Titans within our Walls!

21:37.838 --> 21:42.426
The Scout Regiment and Eren Jaeger's
recall to the capital was rescinded,

21:43.302 --> 21:50.225
and the Scouts were placed in charge of
supervising Annie deep underground.

21:51.852 --> 21:52.769
However,

21:53.645 --> 21:57.858
it would take much more time
and many more lives

21:57.941 --> 22:03.238
for humanity to learn
what was holding it prisoner.
